# 🔴 .env.local holds the DeepSeek key. `COPY . .` in the build stage would put it in a layer, and a
# discarded build stage is not the same as a value that was never there — anyone with the build cache
# has it. Excluded first, and by exact name, so a new deploy/ file cannot quietly re-include it.
.env.local

.git
.github
*.test
docs
